            <div xml:id="m-ea852d73-a427-42f1-930b-281718c444e3">
              <lg xml:id="m-6ae48692-14d7-4f75-bf5c-13d21ad06eb4">
                <l xml:id="m-a23d6814-8bb7-4e5b-a830-a92596cd8b8c" facs="#m-d0c0857e-47fb-4162-af1f-3070bec5289e" label="text-like">At Matins (3rd Nocturn)</l><l xml:id="m-3bcf69bb-5043-4a08-8464-7da5e7021bd0" facs="#m-80389c4e-7b46-40f6-9218-a18d7db2f008" label="ambiguous">640</l><l xml:id="m-5a3230b3-a9e5-464f-973b-3c0ea27a9cae" facs="#m-add03697-3c5a-469d-8b81-e00744630f31" label="lyrics-like">19. In mári vía túa, et sémitae túae in áquis múltis: *et</l><l xml:id="m-2e48d6d2-cb66-42da-8025-bb300454ce89" facs="#m-f5ea2ce2-86e7-4b8d-a40b-f36a69180af6" label="lyrics-like">vestígia túa non cognoscéntur.</l><l xml:id="m-f682b376-6fb9-4a77-b1a8-e8a1c3516dd5" facs="#m-a6e6dc64-d854-4a81-9126-ab16dfcf2e05" label="lyrics-like">20. Deduxisti sicut óves pópulum túum, “in mánu Móysi</l><l xml:id="m-0e1cfb9e-2227-4f7f-80a8-c5ca66d8a139" facs="#m-f6b9f639-c12c-4c17-992b-4cfc5f25a071" label="ambiguous">et Aaron.</l><l xml:id="m-4c2cc001-691a-4108-bcb7-c85309c2982e" facs="#m-ff78a124-27e5-4034-a6cf-d395b52ceb34" label="lyrics-like">V. Exsúrge, Dómine. N. Et júdi-ca cáusam mé¬am.</l><l xml:id="m-b4514e18-96e7-4c34-98ca-e24f4dfea9f7" facs="#m-ed4a97b8-247e-4b81-8e9b-9110fb10306c" label="text-like">Or:</l><l xml:id="m-b61c0cb9-6bdf-4cd3-9ce7-014d3dd1db5e" facs="#m-5b485e25-8cdd-4520-a88a-5ed126467bfa" label="lyrics-like">V. Exsúrge, Dómine. K. Et júdi-ca cáusam mé-am.</l><l xml:id="m-a899adcf-c280-4619-bca3-944b505cc531" facs="#m-f18270b6-c56e-4b5e-ad6b-9333c0c17e20" label="ambiguous">Pater noster. in silence.</l><l xml:id="m-adb24450-820d-4eda-bef7-86ef139b941a" facs="#m-95b3cc8b-11ba-4b36-93cd-6fc1c172cbd1" label="lyrics-like">De Epístola prima beáti Pauli Apóstoli ad Corinthios</l><l xml:id="m-b675009c-0f58-4415-adcb-eb20920c8e46" facs="#m-0f051c60-afbf-46f5-b192-dd2e7b2e68fc" label="ambiguous">Chap. 11, 17-34</l><l xml:id="m-ca76f64e-5a87-4b09-a93a-0cd6c09bf97d" facs="#m-f5174dd0-1f6a-4677-97f4-f2c394342f41" label="ambiguous">LESSON VII</l><l xml:id="m-f56c881c-fa46-4d17-a0ad-ee50c72284a4" facs="#m-585d99b8-9028-4ac8-a44b-a7b5b468ca12" label="lyrics-like">OC autem praccípio: non manducáre. Unusquisque enim</l><l xml:id="m-1dafeea9-d706-4b55-a592-280722dd9134" facs="#m-013bde03-a877-471e-bd0f-f92dd27ecf81" label="lyrics-like">Il laudans quod non in mélius,</l><l xml:id="m-a2010226-391b-430f-9097-da3a7efb373e" facs="#m-293107b5-7414-41fb-9066-7d00d5b35a5f" label="lyrics-like">suam cenam praesúmit ad man¬</l><l xml:id="m-32a05daf-6fef-4bb3-b865-bf7e9d87e348" facs="#m-e9c2875f-eed4-4d6a-97af-de8881c6f26e" label="lyrics-like">sed in detérius convenstis. Pri¬</l><l xml:id="m-f83df6ab-f0eb-4d39-a8e5-e8c2e8b18355" facs="#m-2f026350-abc1-4219-a65d-ef26d3ea6a63" label="lyrics-like">ducándum. Et álius quidem ésu¬</l><l xml:id="m-d2a948f2-108b-4e98-bcff-824125ad71b4" facs="#m-c375c9f4-363a-4f99-a667-14f8d8104bfa" label="lyrics-like">mum quidem conveniéntibus vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-73d92035-d400-468f-b99b-afe03ac7500c" facs="#m-0f41372f-90d5-4c6f-8320-1eacc5d746b6" label="lyrics-like">rit, álius autem ébrius est.</l><l xml:id="m-c7dbea3a-657d-46e3-a1a2-dc49609c8099" facs="#m-eb52b8d9-aeb1-4cad-b75b-26406b5053a3" label="lyrics-like">bis in Ecclésiam, áudio scissúras</l><l xml:id="m-f22e1e3b-f879-4e03-aa2f-9bda8f292a78" facs="#m-4daf0a73-0693-47a6-a7ec-914f7470163b" label="lyrics-like">Numquid domos non habétis ad</l><l xml:id="m-1493f946-a750-4d2a-bb0a-e83fec364074" facs="#m-3ffb3365-b2c6-4c03-a117-9d3d20c0f558" label="ambiguous">esse inter vos, et ex parte</l><l xml:id="m-46e20b59-efed-4c91-bc1c-50e4598f1836" facs="#m-5d3ca10e-7087-4a80-809c-c7dc61be834b" label="lyrics-like">manducándum et bibéndum? aut</l><l xml:id="m-70169a68-4b2d-4266-8e6f-76d0b560e66f" facs="#m-ea360a90-9052-465d-a018-3816c5de7f25" label="lyrics-like">credo. Nam opórtet et haéreses</l><l xml:id="m-2c9893a7-6642-4420-aa0d-612367fecb19" facs="#m-52941653-1dfa-4086-b30d-eb81e4a50210" label="lyrics-like">Ecclésiam Dei contémnitis, et</l><l xml:id="m-bc251b18-d8ef-4d0a-8081-75eefb89fdbe" facs="#m-0ace383c-2584-4bc4-9bde-5d65d333fdd4" label="lyrics-like">confúnditis eos, qui non habent?</l><l xml:id="m-248aea15-ee00-47e4-ba9a-c13ab26733e2" facs="#m-3bbdae09-0396-4424-bc3c-074ec7400a30" label="lyrics-like">esse, ut et qui probáti sunt,</l><l xml:id="m-7f73bc5b-24ed-4d9e-9e8f-3dbf7e92e967" facs="#m-32f94617-d269-4034-b583-f54211b87569" label="ambiguous">Quid dicam vobis? Laudo vos?</l><l xml:id="m-b270faaa-9c04-4f6f-bb1e-100aae774ca1" facs="#m-cc8e8dbb-872d-4134-92ce-9498f8b188e1" label="lyrics-like">manifésti fiant in vobis. Conve¬</l><l xml:id="m-e771fce3-1681-40b7-a546-255ad1d18d18" facs="#m-892cd946-eeb2-41e8-8cae-abdbc6c56d76" label="lyrics-like">niéntibus ergo vobis in unum,</l><l xml:id="m-e9750154-fd30-4f62-87b0-db7ba64c7a3f" facs="#m-b6ba8404-2a3c-4a99-b77e-48fe525f7612" label="ambiguous">in hoc non laudo.</l><l xml:id="m-ce61bf67-f0f3-437a-8999-8ca72d6c7236" facs="#m-12652618-63de-47f3-837c-e0d26ac7ac0c" label="ambiguous">jam non est dominicam cenam</l><l xml:id="m-d11120cd-2dba-422a-a9f5-9826c53b579d" facs="#m-19ce2844-2b56-417e-81fe-352ec3de0ae6" label="ambiguous">Resp.7</l><l xml:id="m-7078f4e5-e689-4755-9ff3-adfda26af902" facs="#m-9b0efab2-9138-44d9-a285-414d7142b4cf" label="lyrics-like">C - ram “qua-si á- gnus ínno¬ cens:</l><l xml:id="m-c0f5178e-1749-49ce-99a1-4233684013ea" facs="#m-ca3ebf24-5cf9-4eb7-9f21-7bbcb1fcca4a" label="lyrics-like">lán- dum, et ne- sci-é¬</l><l xml:id="m-155ac637-31a0-4ee3-961e-ccabb7e2552c" facs="#m-f5673987-92c8-48ea-905b-18d6aaed56cf" label="lyrics-like">dú-ctus sum ad im-mo¬</l><l xml:id="m-e0895bf8-0862-4577-9ec3-3adbe0014ea4" facs="#m-0baf7864-9981-4fa9-aeb4-556913cbcc33" label="lyrics-like">bam: consí-li-um fecé¬ runt in-imí-ci mé- advérsum</l><l xml:id="m-0b0c96d0-74c7-40b3-bed8-030075df0b9b" facs="#m-3ad076c9-aa28-4603-bfce-7a79ef1dabaf" label="lyrics-like">Veni-te, mittámus lígnum in pánem</l><l xml:id="m-1946f888-1c05-4801-8a5a-957edd1f69cd" facs="#m-2dae5663-0e58-4241-9d9c-a0ca1745544a" label="lyrics-like">me, dicéntes:</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>